  "synchronization": "DROP_OLDEST 容量1事件流经sample(.1.seconds)，collectLatest 取消上次等待/淡出；允许显示时snapTo(1)，delay(2.seconds) 后animateTo(0)。graphicsLayer读取alpha，placement更新thumb位置。",
